<title>USA: Spanlink president, COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Spanlink president, COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanlink Communications Inc said Wednesday Patrick Irestone has resigned as president, chief operating officer and member of the board effective July 15.</p>
<p>Spanlink said Irestone plans to start a non-competing company in the Minneapolis area.  </p>
<p>Brett Shockley, founder, chairman and chief executive of Spanlink, has resumed the role of president, the company said.</p>
<p>Spanlink provides computer telephone integration and interactive voice response software and services which link business computer systems, telecommunications systems and the Internet.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
